AUDIENCE: I had active learning
in my electricity and magnetism

1078
00:48:49,697 --> 00:48:50,197
class.

1079
00:48:50,197 --> 00:48:54,040
And that was called TEAL.

1080
00:48:54,040 --> 00:48:58,756
It's very polarized, the people
for and against it, especially

1081
00:48:58,756 --> 00:48:59,870
the students.

1082
00:48:59,870 --> 00:49:03,731
So we basically
had tables of nine.

1083
00:49:03,731 --> 00:49:05,856
