1085
00:49:07,980 --> 00:49:11,973
So you'd have four problems
to solve per two hour class

1086
00:49:11,973 --> 00:49:12,473
period.

1087
00:49:12,473 --> 00:49:14,098
And that would be
going up to the board

1088
00:49:14,098 --> 00:49:16,647
