and then the teacher at the end

1089
00:49:16,647 --> 00:49:18,230
would reveal the
answer and telling us

1090
00:49:18,230 --> 00:49:19,565
how to go through it.

1091
00:49:19,565 --> 00:49:22,952
And for my group at least--

1092
00:49:22,952 --> 00:49:25,638
or my table-- there
was always this one who

1093
00:49:25,638 --> 00:49:28,370
