1096
00:49:35,224 --> 00:49:36,890
JANET RANKIN: It's
definitely polarized.

1097
00:49:36,890 --> 00:49:38,062
Students really are not--

1098
00:49:38,062 --> 00:49:39,770
I think we talked a
